{"c":[{"id":"152b5c9c8901dee0","sum":"Issue #129: BenchLM has no effort spellings. pick.py places an unmatched effort in memory from the stored row and its neighbors; catalog.json stays hand-chosen. Different efforts are not one row, and that placement is a sketch.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260923T215907Z-3b72c8c9f491a1f5","text":"Issue #129: effort-variant slugs must not make pick.py exit 2. Different efforts are not the same row. Synthetic in-memory placement is a sketch, not the decision.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260923T220855Z-f374d7ed9ff469c1","text":"BenchLM models.json has no effort spellings. Issue #129 places an unmatched effort in memory from the stored row and its neighbors; catalog.json stays the hand-chosen set.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"cca16e69e65a762f","sum":"pick.py prints an author spelling it cannot place and exits 0. An unmatched effort is placed in memory. SKILL.md stays a thin caller and does not choose on exit 2.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260923T221500Z-6ea911ac5a9d6f19","text":"choose-verification-model: an author spelling that cannot be placed is printed by the script and exits 0. The skill stays a thin caller and does not choose on exit 2.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260923T222445Z-2c0343a88b556f38","text":"OUTCOME: pick.py places unmatched effort spellings in memory. An author it cannot place is printed and the process exits 0. SKILL.md stays a thin caller.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
